    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are now in the Dark Sector, but you are not welcome here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a scrapper in this <i><strong>survival horror roguelike</strong></i>, where every bullet counts, every corner hides a danger and your sanity is as precious as your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848030/extras/08a7e956b5b8ce152f92856232f1f947.poster.avif?t=1755124270\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848030/extras/08a7e956b5b8ce152f92856232f1f947.webm?t=1755124270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848030/extras/08a7e956b5b8ce152f92856232f1f947.mp4?t=1755124270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge</strong> - explore every research station for the resources you will need on your journey home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover</strong> - much was learned in the Dark Sector, dangerous knowledge that is now yours to find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive\u00a0</strong>- menage a variety of scrapped equipment in your inventory to stay alive through the dangers of the Dark Sector.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repeat\u00a0</strong>- not every scrapper will have the same luck. For every scrapper dying alone in space, countless others will be fighting for their lives.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are now in the Dark Sector, but you are not welcome here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a scrapper in this <i><strong>survival horror roguelike</strong></i>, where every bullet counts, every corner hides a danger and your sanity is as precious as your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848030/extras/08a7e956b5b8ce152f92856232f1f947.poster.avif?t=1755124270\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848030/extras/08a7e956b5b8ce152f92856232f1f947.webm?t=1755124270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848030/extras/08a7e956b5b8ce152f92856232f1f947.mp4?t=1755124270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge</strong> - explore every research station for the resources you will need on your journey home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover</strong> - much was learned in the Dark Sector, dangerous knowledge that is now yours to find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive\u00a0</strong>- menage a variety of scrapped equipment in your inventory to stay alive through the dangers of the Dark Sector.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repeat\u00a0</strong>- not every scrapper will have the same luck. For every scrapper dying alone in space, countless others will be fighting for their lives.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "You were a scrapper living out the wastes in deep space, but now you have to leave. In this survival horror roguelike you have no choice but to gather resources, one abandoned station at a time, until you can reach the portal home and flee from the horrors of the Dark Sector.",
